  "title": "Update on the situation in the Middle East",
  "summary": "Considering the crisis in the Middle East, TotalEnergies has decided to organize the return of employees’ families present in several countries in the region. To this end, TotalEnergies has mobilized logistical resources and is coordinating its actions with local authorities. TotalEnergies is fully committed to closely monitoring developments of the situation in order to implement […]",
